# What must not reach the build context.
#
# `local/` is the line that matters: it holds the Anthropic API key and the
# personal profile seed. It is gitignored for that reason and it is excluded
# here for the same one — a key that never entered the repository should not
# enter an image that gets pushed to a public registry either. The Dockerfile
# copies named paths rather than `COPY . .`, so this is belt and braces, and
# that is the correct amount for a credential.

.git/
.github/
.venv/
.claude/
.claude-worktrees/
.claude/worktrees/
local/

# Committed artifacts for inspection, not things the app reads at runtime.
build/

# The suite brings its own Postgres and runs from a checkout; it has no job
# inside the image.
tests/

__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
.DS_Store

# Prose that ships in the repo rather than the image. README.md and LICENSE
# are exceptions — pyproject names them and the build needs them.
docs/
CONTRIBUTING.md
CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
CLAUDE.md
DIRECTION.md
